 "confirm.en": "<div class=\"page-header\"><h1 class=\"page-title\">Install firmware fw-v1.1.0?</h1></div><!--flash-slot--><p class=\"text-body\">The frame will download and install this version at its next wake, around 08:14. It will keep the update after one successful check-in — otherwise it rolls back automatically.</p><form method=\"post\" action=\"/update/install\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"version\" value=\"fw-v1.1.0\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"confirm\" value=\"yes\"><button type=\"submit\">Install</button></form><p><a class=\"text-label\" href=\"/update\">Cancel</a></p>",
